[ti:Day 08]

[00:00.00]momentum 例 He needs momentum and efforts to realise his targets. 他需要动力和努力去实现他的目标。
[00:08.34]intervene 例 The market economy can only function if the state intervenes. 只有在政府干预的情况下， 市场经济才能发挥作用。
[00:17.93]assent 例 His assent to the proposal clinched the bargain. 他对提案的赞成最终促成了这笔交易。
[00:25.35]bundle 例 He was burdened with a large bundle of magazines. 他吃力地抱着一大捆杂志。
[00:32.77]segregate 例 The device is used to segregate hazardous waste. 该装置用来隔离有害废弃物。
[00:40.66]panic 例 The rumour is panicing many citizens into buying edible salt. 谣言让许多市民感到恐慌而抢 购食用盐。
[00:49.62]identity 例 To implement this requirement, you should properly configure the authentication of a user identity. 为了实现这一需求，你应该正确地配置 用户身份的授权。
[01:04.31]outstrip 例 In America, the tuition increase outstrips inflation by four percentage points annually. 在 美国，每年的学费增长率超过通货膨胀率四个百 分点。
[01:17.61]guilder 例 The Dutch guilder was retired in 2002 when it was replaced by the Euro. 荷兰盾在2002年停 用，被欧元取代。
[01:27.81]community 例 The conference will make further efforts to enlist the support of the international community for their just struggle. 会议将进一 步动员国际社会来支持他们的正义斗争。
[01:44.97]camaraderie 例 This time, a stronger and more confident China is sending messages of conciliation and camaraderie. 这次，更强大、更自信的中国正发 出渴望和解与建立友谊的信息。
[01:59.97]infuse 例 The corporation may lose the opportunity to infuse flexibility into the IT portfolio. 公司可 能会失去为 IT投资组合增加灵活性的机会。
[02:12.33]countersign 例 You will receive our S/C and please countersign and return one copy to us for file. 您将会收到我们的销货合同，请签署后寄回一份 供我们存档。
[02:24.70]undercut 例 The policy undercut farming operations, and prevented farmers from receiving the real value of their commodities. 这一政策削弱了农 业生产，并妨碍农民获得其农产品的真正价值。
[02:41.24]quittance 例 Omittance is no quittance. 不催账并不等于 销账。
[02:46.35]wrongfully 例 He is wrongfully dismissed. 他是被非法解雇 的。
[02:51.76]dominate 例 No nation should try to dominate another nation. 任何一个国家都不应该试图主宰另一个国 家。
[02:59.49]foreground 例 It's great to see this large technology company at the foreground of the trend. 很高 兴看到这家大型科技公司能够走在潮流的最前 沿。
[03:11.39]flier 例 Someone gave me this advertising flier at the entrance. 在入口处有人给我发了张广告传 单。
[03:19.59]bridging 例 Hindi is the national language of the country, whereas English is the bridging language that will give you an indication of community. 北印度语是这个国家的民族语言，而 英语是一门能表明所处社区的“桥梁”语言。
[03:38.45]negotiable 例 The prices of the commodity are negotiable for quantity purchases. 批量购买的话，商品价 格可以商量。
[03:48.96]snip 例 This computer is a snip at ￥2,000. 这台电 脑很便宜，才2000元。 die down 逐渐减弱至消失
[03:54.06]overtly 例 The director has overtly announced his support for technical innovation. 主管已经明确 表示了他对技术创新的支持。
[04:05.04]impart 例 I really have no secret about business to impart to you. 我真没有什么商业机密可向你透 露。
[04:13.23]gratuity 例 The tipping problem in many European countries is solved by automatically adding a 15 percent gratuity to the bill. 许多欧洲国家通 过在账单中自动加收15%的小费解决了付小费的 问题。
[04:29.62]resell 例 I find it difficult to resell shares of the company. 我发现这家公司的股票很难转售。
[04:37.35]colleague 例 Every colleague has the right to express his own opinion. 每一位同事都有权表达自己的观 点。
[04:46.32]secondment 例 She was sent to the sales department on secondment. 她被借调到了销售部门。
[04:54.67]concession 例 I am prepared to make some concessions on minor details, but I cannot compromise on fundamentals. 在一些细节上我可以作出让步， 但在基本原则上我是不会妥协的。
[05:09.04]bourse 例 The NYSE management team has a strong incentive to push for the Deutsche Bourse deal. 纽交所管理层有很强的动力来推动与德意志 交易所的合并。
[05:21.10]debit 例 The new policy offers the additional options to pay online with a debit card. 新政策为使用借
[05:31.92]equity 例 The equity-based earnings rose a lot. 基于 股本的盈利增长了不少。
[05:37.95]constantly 例 We must constantly adjust the amount of currency in circulation. 我们必须不断调节货币 流通的数量。
[05:48.16]affinity 例 It is clear that there exists an affinity between open politics and open markets. 显 然，开明的政治和开放型市场之间存在密切关 系。
[06:00.06]feedback 例 We want to share our feedback and discuss this in the working group. 我们希望与 工作团队分享我们的成果，并对之进行讨论。
[06:10.11]extensive 例 Extensive reading is a good way to enlarge your vision. 广泛的阅读是扩大视野的好方法。
[06:18.77]default 例 As a result of the following financial crisis, the company did default on its short-term notes. 由于后来的金融危机，这家公司拖欠了应 付的短期票据。
[06:32.37]commandment 例 Think about how important this commandment is to society and nation. 想想这 条戒律对于社会与民族是多么重要。
[06:43.20]commentator 例 According to this view, the perfect economics commentator should have been carefully protected from academic economics. 按照这种观点，应当保护这位优秀的经济评论 员，使其免受学院派经济学的浸染。
[07:01.13]faction 例 The progressive faction demanded a reserve system and currency supply owned and controlled by the government. 激进派要求 储备制度和货币供应量都为政府所有和控制。
[07:16.90]tackle 例 We must coordinate better to tackle the world's ongoing financial crisis. 我们必须更好 地协调，来应对全世界面临的金融危机。
[07:27.72]swamp 例 He is always swamped with work. 他总是工 作多得难以招架。 spending power 购买力；消费力
[07:32.67]garment 例 The inspiration for this garment is the bat's echolocation system. 这件衣服的设计灵感源自 蝙蝠的回声定位系统。
[07:42.72]concise 例 Be sure to make your resume clear and concise and avoid long-windedness. 确保你的 简历清晰、简洁，避免长篇大论。
[07:53.38]embassy 例 Before visiting a foreign country, you need to go to the corresponding embassy to get a visa first. 出国前，你首先需要去相应的大使馆办 理签证。
[08:07.30]appease 例 The move was widely seen as an attempt to appease critics of the regime. 这一举措被普 遍认为是用来安抚那些批评政权的人的。
[08:17.66]cognitive 例 These findings prove the link between exercise and improved cognitive function. 这些 研究结果证实运动与认知功能改善之间存在着联 系。
[08:29.87]golden 例 Each director will get a large golden pension. 每一位经理都会得到丰厚的津贴。
[08:36.98]embargo 例 The US abandoned the trade embargo on many countries. 美国解除了对许多国家的贸易禁 运令。
[08:45.17]survive 例 Despite the uncertainty of the commercial world, some businesses do survive for centuries. 尽管商界形势瞬息万变，有些企业却 存活了数个世纪。
[08:58.47]alter 例 The digital age has brought all of us new and exciting tools that will surely continue to alter the way we learn and work. 数字时代已经 给我们带来了令人兴奋的新工具，这些工具必将 继续改变我们学习和工作的方式。
[09:14.70]code 例 The Patent Office rejected his application, citing a clause in the patent code which says that life forms are not patentable. 专利局拒绝 了他的申请，原因是专利法典中的一项条款中规 定，生命形态不属于可取得专利的范围。
[09:31.71]manipulate 例 Throughout his career, he has very successfully manipulated the market with the help of media. 在整个职业生涯中，他很成功地 借助媒体的力量操纵了市场走势。
[09:45.78]bearer 例 The payer is supposed to be liable to the bearer. 付款人应当对持票人承担责任。
[09:53.04]regulator 例 The government often plays the role of watchdog and regulator in marketing operations. 在市场运作中，政府通常扮演监督者 和调控者的角色。
[10:06.03]favouritism 例 The U.S. gets middling global rankings on issues like wasteful government spending and favoritism by government officials. 在政府支出 的浪费和政府官员徇私等问题上，美国在全球排 名居中。
